Is that Excalibur from a bones level or was it just lying around?

In case it once was a sacrifice gift you could dip it in fountains,
it may uncurse. (You should be able to handle fountain effects if
you do that.)

> I've got:
> 
> a) ? priceID 80, cursed
> b) ? priceID 60-80, uncursed
> c) ? priceID 60-80, cursed

(What's you charisma; around 16?)

Are b) and c) the same (modulo the BUC factor), or different scrolls.

If you have more than one important thing to uncurse I would bless a
"scroll of 80", put on a piece of armor that I intend to keep for a
long time, and read the scroll; either your inventory gets uncursed
or you got at least a better piece of armor.

Reading an uncurse "scroll of 60" will enchant a weapon (and it will
also remove any curse, AFAIK). Both is good if you intend to use
Excalibur (for some significant time) as your primary weapon.

